This product includes software developed for the PostgreSQL Experiment
Workbench project.

The source-containing scenario pack includes exact Go test dependencies that
are not linked into the pgworkbench release binary:

- github.com/dlclark/regexp2 v1.11.0, licensed under MIT. Its retained
  upstream ATTRIB file also records incorporated .NET, Go, and Mono notices.
- github.com/santhosh-tekuri/jsonschema/v6 v6.0.2, licensed under
  Apache-2.0.
- golang.org/x/text v0.14.0, licensed under BSD-3-Clause with the retained
  upstream PATENTS grant.

The machine-readable inventory, exact versions, module checksums, license
identifiers, and retained upstream license bytes are under third_party/.
Release SBOMs model these packages as TEST_DEPENDENCY_OF the source-containing
root package. Runtime dependency claims are derived independently from Go build
information in the packaged pgworkbench binary; the v0.2.0 binary has no
external Go module dependencies.
